{"id": "1535669619342180367", "channel_id": "1535669619342180367", "author_id": "735137568307282011", "author_name": "reya.li", "content": "*\"Must be What They Call Love·E3\n\nViscera Blossoms deals an additional 0.5% of the target's Max HP as Corrosion. For every stack of Gynoecium consumed by Song of Saya, the next time Viscera Blossoms is played, draw 1 additional card.\"*\n\nI've noticed similar glitches happen before occasionally, but this is the first time I really got it on video. In this case, I used a Saya Exalt consuming 2 Gynoecium stacks to target Xu. \n\nThe next Viscera Blossoms played could discard 2 Command Cards, so it should draw (2+2) 4 cards in total. For some reason the card instead claimed it would draw 8 cards upon use (which doesn't make sense), and when actually playing it it only drew 2 new cards.", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T15:22:48.613000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535669619342180367", "attachments": [{"id": "1535669622735503410", "filename": "budger2.mp4", "content_type": "video/mp4", "size": 63046360, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535669619342180367/1535669622735503410/budger2.mp4?ex=6a794409&is=6a77f289&hm=8f222a02f5d27be6b083b410ee575ab8d4ab20b7aa7dd5ccec236f03ae6a081d&"}], "thread_title": "Saya Enlighten 3 draw effect not working properly sometimes", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1535563372068872232", "channel_id": "1535563372068872232", "author_id": "1347967445654306910", "author_name": "kinoko5pro", "content": "一个是开局无法觉醒，如果觉醒成功界面应该显示2000银钥。\n另一个是开局觉醒后发现可以再次觉醒，为了固定证据我把这关打过了，阵容配置给的很低，所以在记录里筛选下阵容就能找到这场战斗。", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T08:20:37.289000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535563372068872232", "attachments": [{"id": "1535563373436076103", "filename": "1.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 3857934, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535563372068872232/1535563373436076103/1.png?ex=6a78e115&is=6a778f95&hm=943fe5a07ed340c36322b73b409f2c10731ae9edab3d79dad28feddd4d0925f0&"}, {"id": "1535563374283202581", "filename": "2.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 8787769, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535563372068872232/1535563374283202581/2.png?ex=6a78e115&is=6a778f95&hm=85626a10a96951b1fca54ebb7fa5ffae5b175347a9281eec52853e7fc3127e35&"}, {"id": "1535563374874595348", "filename": "20260808140604_1.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 1142896, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535563372068872232/1535563374874595348/20260808140604_1.jpg?ex=6a78e115&is=6a778f95&hm=aa3ceff8b4bcc93656d8f2a2bb9fb272dcfe6d64ed48263a5efaec34279aefc1&"}], "thread_title": "融灾5-5蚀萝遇到两次不同的觉醒bug", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168103141416960", "1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1535587496703041536", "channel_id": "1535000394927702128", "author_id": "718101727093456958", "author_name": "watchthew0rldburn", "content": "绝对同意，因为萝坦的确好战，也确实爱到处挑战，但很重点是她不屑不配的对手，简直不会对他们的存在当一回事\n\n二版带有鄙视嘲讽的语气在这个人设来看就很有出入了，因为她会直接无视\n\n反观原版，就好比如找到值得她出手的对手，因此好战的她就显得激昂难耐（千年难得一战平时不得闷死）", "timestamp": "2026-08-08T09:56:29.050000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535000394927702128", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-08T09:57:03.572000+00:00", "thread_title": "sp蘿坦配音可否考慮回調", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168197425172480", "1181168158678204497", "1361168939622727801", "1361169005435420785"]}
